OL,3,GNEWSATwo teens arrested over boy
OL,4,Astabbed at shopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of grievous bodily harm after
OL,8,Fa 14-year-old was stabbed at Manchester
OL,9,FArndale shopping centre.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to the centre's
OL,12,Fninth-floor car park on Saturday, where
OL,13,Fthey found a teenager with stab wounds.
OL,15,FHe remains in hospital in a stable
OL,16,Fcondition.
OL,18,FTwo boys, both aged 14, were arrested
OL,19,Fon Sunday and remain in custody for
OL,20,Fquestioning.
